<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21101" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύθακες</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>silken tunics</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύκαι:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἱεραί</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύκαιναι: ἱεραί</span>)
			(<span class="entity">Dorian</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρῡκᾰνάομαι</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρυχ-</span>
			, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρυκεδανός:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυφάγος, οἱ δὲ μακρός</span>, Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρυκετός</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρυγμός</span>
			, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύκος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρυξ</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύοχος</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, οἱ δὲ
			βάρβαρος</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρούχετος</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, οἱ δὲ
				ἀττέλεβος</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροῦκος</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρυκταία</span></b> , a kind of <i>plant</i>, Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
